{"id":"sh/dcbm583y","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 4","position":{"left":89.28,"top":194.88,"width":322.56,"height":271.68},"text":"模擬捜索の所要時間\n\n補正なしと比べ\n中央値20%短縮を目標。\n\n場所別に10回以上試し、\n測位誤差と送信の遅れも\n分けて記録する。","style":{"fontSize":21,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/sb2lcnmd","kind":"shape","name":"Shape 5","position":{"left":441.6,"top":148.8,"width":357.12,"height":331.2},"style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#F5F7FA","lineColor":"#D9DEE7","lineWidth":1.33},
{"id":"sh/b6d4f2lc","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 6","position":{"left":458.88,"top":160.32,"width":270,"height":26.88},"text":"使い続けられるか","style":{"fontSize":18.67,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/a543mx4r","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 7","position":{"left":458.88,"top":194.88,"width":322.56,"height":271.68},"text":"30日間の試用継続率\n\n目標80%以上。\n\n首輪を嫌がる、重い、\n充電が手間といった\n中止理由も記録する。\n少人数なので件数も示す。","style":{"fontSize":21,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/wvupgz6t","kind":"shape","name":"Shape 8","position":{"left":811.2,"top":148.8,"width":395.52,"height":331.2},"style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#F5F7FA","lineColor":"#D9DEE7","lineWidth":1.33},
{"id":"sh/xw3q94ne","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 9","position":{"left":828.48,"top":160.32,"width":350,"height":26.88},"text":"料金を払う価値があるか","style":{"fontSize":18.67,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/atc7epon","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 10","position":{"left":828.48,"top":194.88,"width":360.96,"height":271.68},"text":"試用後の有料申込率\n\n目標30%以上。\n\n月額780円と本体価格を\n提示して意思を確認する。\n契約数と解約率を追い、\n採算に届くか見直す。","style":{"fontSize":21,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/bulo7u58","kind":"shape","name":"Shape 11","position":{"left":72,"top":513.6,"width":1134.72,"height":78.72},"style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"roundRect","fillColor":"#FFFDF0","lineColor":"#E8D750","lineWidth":1.33},
{"id":"sh/orapcf6h","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 12","position":{"left":89.28,"top":525.12,"width":316.8,"height":26.88},"text":"自分の行動とのつながり","style":{"fontSize":14.67,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","bold":true,"alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
{"id":"sh/9sj65kn2","kind":"textbox","name":"Text 13","position":{"left":89.28,"top":559.68,"width":1100.16,"height":45},"text":"アンテナ・表示の改善で捜索時間を減らし、重量・充電の改善で継続率を高める。","style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Noto Sans CJK JP","color":"#333333","alignment":"left"},"geometry":"rect"},
